            "review_title": "Review at Somtam Zaap",
            "review_text": "Anh Amắn 🇻🇳\nHo Chi Minh City, Vietnam12939 contributions\n17\nSpicy Thai/Isaan cuisine in Saigon\nDec 2024 • Friends\nThis is a nice Thai/Isaan restaurant in Saigon. I brought a local friend here tonight to have his first taste of authentic Thai food. I explained that the Isaan region is in the North East of Thailand and is influenced by Loation cuisine. The food tends to be more spicy with emphasis on spices and herbs. The food is full of flavour. The heat (hot chili) will catch up with you, so do tell the waiter if you prefer dishes to be mild.\n\nThis restaurant is actually pretty authentic if not spot on. Very reasonably priced as well. I would eat here again.\nRead more\nWritten December 13, 2024",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
